<title>UK: Mexico sets 300 mln stg five-year bond,175 bp over.</title>
<headline>Mexico sets 300 mln stg five-year bond,175 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEXICO</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT JUNE 2002 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
